{"id":"n5_u11_l1","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"More everyday verbs","goal":"Learn twelve more polite verbs.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_asobimasu","v_hatarakimasu","v_torimasu","v_tsukaimasu","v_oshiemasu","v_hairimasu","v_demasu","v_norimasu","v_suwarimasu","v_akemasu","v_shimemasu","v_nugimasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Work, play, open, close","body":["あそびます (play), はたらきます (work), とります (take a photo), つかいます (use), おしえます (teach), はいります (enter), でます (leave), のります (ride), すわります (sit), あけます (open), しめます (close), ぬぎます (take off)."],"examples":[{"ja":"しゃしん を とります","reading":"shashin o torimasu","en":"I take a photo."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_vb01","q_n5u11_vb02","q_n5u11_vb03","q_n5u11_vb04","q_n5u11_vb05","q_n5u11_vb06","q_n5u11_vb07","q_n5u11_vb08","q_n5u11_vb09","q_n5u11_vb10","q_n5u11_vb11","q_n5u11_vb12","q_n5u11_ty05","q_n5u11_tr01","q_n5u11_tr02","q_n5u11_tr03","q_n5u11_tr04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_vb01","q_n5u11_vb03","q_n5u11_vb06","q_n5u11_vb09","q_n5u11_vb10","q_n5u11_vb12","q_n5u11_tr03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u11_l2","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"A hot-spring town","goal":"Learn words for a resort trip.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_yukkuri","v_hayaku","v_mouichido","v_yukata","v_ofuro","v_onsen","v_roopuwei","v_mizuumi","v_keshiki","v_jikan"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Resort words","body":["おんせん (hot spring), おふろ (bath), ゆかた (yukata), ロープウェイ (ropeway), みずうみ (lake), けしき (view). Adverbs: ゆっくり (slowly), はやく (quickly), もういちど (once more)."],"examples":[{"ja":"みずうみ の けしき は きれい です","reading":"mizuumi no keshiki wa kirei desu","en":"The view of the lake is beautiful."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_ty01","q_n5u11_ty02","q_n5u11_ty03","q_n5u11_ty04","q_n5u11_dc02","q_n5u11_dc03","q_n5u11_tr05","q_n5u11_tr07","q_n5u11_vm_yukkuri","q_n5u11_vm_hayaku","q_n5u11_vm_mouichido","q_n5u11_vm_yukata","q_n5u11_vm_ofuro","q_n5u11_vm_onsen","q_n5u11_vm_roopuwei","q_n5u11_vm_mizuumi","q_n5u11_vm_keshiki","q_n5u11_vm_jikan"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_ty01","q_n5u11_ty02","q_n5u11_ty03","q_n5u11_dc02","q_n5u11_tr07"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u11_l3","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Wanting: たい and ほしい","goal":"Say what you want to do and what you want.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_hoshii"],"grammar":["g_tai_hoshii"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Want to do, want a thing","body":["Stem + たい: たべたい です. Negative: たべたく ない です. A thing you want: スマホ が ほしい です."],"examples":[{"ja":"おんせん へ いきたい です","reading":"onsen e ikitai desu","en":"I want to go to a hot spring."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_gt01","q_n5u11_gt02","q_n5u11_gt03","q_n5u11_gt04","q_n5u11_gt05","q_n5u11_gt06","q_n5u11_gt07","q_n5u11_tr06","q_n5u11_so01","q_n5u11_so03","q_n5u11_vm_hoshii"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_gt01","q_n5u11_gt02","q_n5u11_gt03","q_n5u11_gt04","q_n5u11_gt05","q_n5u11_tr06"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u11_l4","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Counting things and ordering","goal":"Order things by number.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_ct_hitotsu","v_ct_futatsu","v_ct_mittsu","v_ct_yottsu","v_ct_itsutsu","v_ct_muttsu","v_ct_nanatsu","v_ct_yattsu","v_ct_kokonotsu","v_ct_too"],"grammar":["g_counting_things"]},"explain":[{"heading":"The -tsu series","body":["ひとつ, ふたつ, みっつ, よっつ, いつつ, むっつ, ななつ, やっつ, ここのつ, とお. Place the count before ください: コーヒー を ふたつ ください."],"examples":[{"ja":"ケーキ を ひとつ ください","reading":"keeki o hitotsu kudasai","en":"One cake, please."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_cn01","q_n5u11_cn02","q_n5u11_cn03","q_n5u11_cn04","q_n5u11_cn05","q_n5u11_cn06","q_n5u11_cn07","q_n5u11_cn08","q_n5u11_cn09","q_n5u11_cn10","q_n5u11_cnmt01","q_n5u11_cnmt02","q_n5u11_cnq01","q_n5u11_cnq02","q_n5u11_cnq03","q_n5u11_cnq04","q_n5u11_cnq05","q_n5u11_cnq06","q_n5u11_gx01","q_n5u11_gx02","q_n5u11_gx03","q_n5u11_gx04","q_n5u11_gx05","q_n5u11_gx06","q_n5u11_ty06","q_n5u11_ty07","q_n5u11_dc04","q_n5u11_gl05","q_n5u11_gl06","q_n5u11_gl07"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_cn01","q_n5u11_cn03","q_n5u11_cn05","q_n5u11_cnmt01","q_n5u11_cnq01","q_n5u11_cnq02","q_n5u11_gx01","q_n5u11_ty06","q_n5u11_gl05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u11_l5","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"The て-form","goal":"Make the て-form of the polite verbs.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_te_form"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Sound changes","body":["Group 2 (る-verbs): drop ます, add て: たべて. Group 1: い/ち/り → って; み/び/に → んで; き → いて; ぎ → いで; し → して. Exception: いきます → いって. Irregular: します → して, きます → きて."],"examples":[{"ja":"のみます → のんで","reading":"nomimasu → nonde","en":"drink → drinking form"},{"ja":"かきます → かいて","reading":"kakimasu → kaite","en":"write → writing form"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_tf01","q_n5u11_tf02","q_n5u11_tf03","q_n5u11_tf04","q_n5u11_tf05","q_n5u11_tf06","q_n5u11_tf07","q_n5u11_tf08","q_n5u11_tf09","q_n5u11_tf10","q_n5u11_tf11","q_n5u11_tf12","q_n5u11_tf13","q_n5u11_tf14","q_n5u11_tf15","q_n5u11_tf16","q_n5u11_tf17","q_n5u11_tf18","q_n5u11_tf19","q_n5u11_tf20","q_n5u11_tfmt01","q_n5u11_tfmt02","q_n5u11_ge01","q_n5u11_ge02","q_n5u11_ge03"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_tf01","q_n5u11_tf05","q_n5u11_tf08","q_n5u11_tf10","q_n5u11_tf13","q_n5u11_tf16","q_n5u11_tf17","q_n5u11_tfmt01","q_n5u11_ge01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u11_l6","unit_id":"n5_u11","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Please do: て-form + ください","goal":"Make polite requests.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_te_kudasai"]},"explain":[{"heading":"A request","body":["て-form + ください means \"please do\": ちょっと まって ください, しゃしん を とって ください, くつ を ぬいで ください."],"examples":[{"ja":"ゆっくり はなして ください","reading":"yukkuri hanashite kudasai","en":"Please speak slowly."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_gr01","q_n5u11_gr02","q_n5u11_gr03","q_n5u11_gr04","q_n5u11_gr05","q_n5u11_gr06","q_n5u11_ge04","q_n5u11_ge05","q_n5u11_ge06","q_n5u11_so02","q_n5u11_tr08","q_n5u11_tr09","q_n5u11_dc01","q_n5u11_gl01","q_n5u11_gl02","q_n5u11_gl03","q_n5u11_gl04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u11_gr01","q_n5u11_gr02","q_n5u11_gr03","q_n5u11_gr05","q_n5u11_ge04","q_n5u11_ge06","q_n5u11_gl01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
